### get all tags
GET http://localhost:4000/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create Tag
POST http://localhost:4000/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "React",
    "slug": "react",
    "description": "This is a react tag",
    "schema": "{\"sideBarExpanded\": false, \"headerExpanded\": true}",
    "featuredImageUrl": "http://localhost.com/tags/images/first-tag.jpg"
}